{# Jinja2 template for the standalone pipeline report. Implemented in Phase 5 alongside
   bin/make_report.py.

   Design constraints:
     * Single self-contained file. Figures are embedded as base64 data URIs, never referenced by
       relative path, so the report survives being emailed or moved.
     * No CDN links. A report that needs the internet to render is not an archive.
     * Must tell the whole story without the reader opening any PNG.

   Expected context (keep this list in sync with make_report.py):
     sample        dict   id, n_cells, n_spots, n_sc_clusters, n_sp_clusters, n_shared_genes
     sections      list   [{title, description, figures: [{caption, b64}], tables: [{caption, html}]}]
     versions      dict   tool -> version
     run           dict   nextflow_version, pipeline_version, timestamp, command_line
#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Spatial Immune Atlas — {{ sample.id }}</title>
  <!-- TODO Phase 5: inline CSS here. -->
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Spatial Immune Atlas</h1>
